    "text": "BY Virtue of powers vested to me under section 154F. (5) of the 13th Amendment to the Constitution of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka, I, M.P. Jayasinghe, Governor of Uva Province, do hereby announce that I have made the followingappointment for the Provincial Council of Uva Province, with effect from the date 26th March, 2018.",
